  "summary": "Software Engineer with 5+ years of professional experience developing, integrating, and maintaining complex software systems.\n\nMy background includes C/C++ and Python development, Linux environments, build systems, CI/CD automation, systems integration, debugging, and technical problem-solving across multidisciplinary teams.\n\nI also work independently on projects involving backend applications, data processing, statistical modeling, and AI/ML tooling.\n\nI'm interested in backend, platform, and infrastructure software engineering roles where I can apply my systems background while developing deeper experience with production services and distributed systems.\n\nPortfolio: https://www.scienceopera.net/career",
