    "description": "• Interfaced Java code generation directly to SQL Server through an ORM and integrated schema validation, scheduled data retrieval, and generated artifacts into CI/CD.\n• Maintained GitLab CI/CD and CMake/Meson/Ninja workflows; added Docker Compose and CI configurations to standardize multi-variant builds and tests.\n• Added reuse of branch and submodule build artifacts and integrated artifact and container repositories to reduce redundant builds and build-cluster contention.\n• Contributed to replacing a legacy C++ service interface with gRPC and Protocol Buffers to address binary-layout, endianness, and schema-evolution problems.\n• Contributed to Python-accessible simulation middleware using C FFI and SWIG, enabling scenario and schema updates without rebuilding the full native codebase.\n• Contributed to automated artifact deployment to networked QEMU virtual machines and hardware-in-the-loop testbeds for integration testing.\n• Mentored junior engineers and served as a subsystem resource during implementation, integration, and delivery milestones.",
